      "costUsd": 0.006310499999999999,
      "pronunciationText": "Back to the fundraiser. Its total is a thousand times the natural log of t, plus C. Here t is positive, so no absolute value is needed. After day one, two thousand dollars is in, and the natural log of one is zero, so C is two thousand. Each time the number of days doubles, it grows by the same amount, about six hundred and ninety-three dollars. It never stops growing, but it keeps slowing down."
