      "pronunciationText": "One more from last video. Find the integral of e to the minus x, plus three over x, plus x squared. Last video gave minus e to the minus x. Three over x gives three times the natural log of mod x. And x squared gives x cubed over three. One plus C covers the lot, and x can't be zero."
